<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIA TAKE WINNING LEAD OVER S.AFRICA IN FED CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIA TAKE WINNING LEAD OVER S.AFRICA IN FED CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN, South Africa 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia took a winning 3-1 lead over South Africa in a Fed Cup tennis World Group two tie after taking the second reverse singles on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results (Australian names first):</p>
<p>Played Sunday</p>
<p>Rachel McQuillan beat Joannette Kruger 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>Annabel Ellwood lost to Amanda Coetzer 6-1 1-6 0-6</p>
<p>Played Saturday</p>
<p>Ellwood beat Kruger 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>McQuillian beat Coetzer 6-3 7-6 (12-10).</p>
</text>
